Name: Avery Lin Calder;
Alias/Nickname: Ave;
Age: 18;
Gender: Female;
Species/Race: Vampire;
Height: 5'0";
Build: lean and wiry with light muscle definition;
Hair: black hair, shoulder-length and wavy;
Eyes: dark brown;
Skin: fair with cool undertones;
Scars: A thin scar across the right knee from a childhood fall.;

Origin: Turned undead; their turning lineage traces back through sires to one of the Seven Original Vampires.;
Place of Birth: Toronto, Ontario;
Birthdate: January 1, 2008;

Personality: Avery is quietly intense. They are observant, loyal, and hard to fool. Around trusted cabinmates they loosen noticeably, but conflict exposes the harder edge of their personality: they withdraws instead of explaining hurt. They are capable of humor, tenderness, jealousy, boredom, anger, attraction, and poor judgment rather than functioning as a single supernatural stereotype.;

Strengths: Observant, loyal, and hard to fool. Avery is especially reliable when a situation requires patience, reading a room, or committing to a decision once they have made it.;
Weaknesses: Sunlight, silver, catastrophic heart or head trauma, blood starvation, and predatory loss of control under severe hunger. Personally, Avery is most destabilized by losing control in front of someone they care about.;
Flaws: Withdraws instead of explaining hurt. They can rationalize this flaw as self-protection long after it starts hurting other people.;
Fears: Losing control in front of someone they care about. The fear affects their choices without controlling every scene.;
Quirks: Labels every personal storage box even when nobody else touches it.;
Habits: Takes a long lap around the rec district before bed.;
Powers: Superhuman strength, speed, reflexes, regeneration, heightened senses, fangs, ageless undead physiology, baseline compulsion, and a personal vampiric gift focused on fine emotional reading.;
Unique Triats: Does not require ordinary sleep and can survive trauma that would kill a living human; blood taste and scent are unusually precise. Their current individual specialty is fine emotional reading, giving their power use a personal style instead of making them interchangeable with others of the same race.;

Education: Camp Mystic Five-Year Residential Program — Year 1; G-01 Moonflower Cabin. Completed secondary school before arrival and now takes online community-college courses.;
Training: Current Camp Mystic training includes blood-hunger regulation, compulsion ethics, speed braking, regeneration limits, and fine emotional reading, emergency shutdown procedure, consent law, feeding/donor safety where relevant, and independent-living preparation.;
Past Occupation/Role: Currently a Camp Mystic camper; previously student with occasional restaurant work.;

Physical Skills: Avery has solid camp-level conditioning, swimming and first-aid basics, plus above-average coordination from repeated control drills. Their strongest non-supernatural physical skill is archery and controlled breathing.;

Personal Items of Note: A battered silver-cased mp3 player that belonged to an older sibling.;
Favorite Things: Late-night horror movies, fries, and thunderstorms.;
Pet Peeves: People touching their things without asking.;

Fun Fact: Can solve a standard Rubik's cube in under a minute.;
Secret: Avery has a crush on someone their cabin assumes they hate.;
Philosophy: "Control should create freedom, not smaller cages.";
Motivation: Graduate with an independent feeding or health plan and their own apartment.;

Backstory: Avery asked to come voluntarily after realizing hunger and shame were controlling more of daily life than they admitted. A frightening hunger episode after turning made the family realize stored blood and ordinary household rules were not enough. They entered Moonflower Cabin expecting Camp Mystic to feel like exile. By Year 1, the camp has become a complicated mix of refuge, frustration, friendship, and unfinished work. Their story is not about becoming harmless; it is about becoming responsible without losing the parts of themselves that make life worth having.;

Name: Sofia Mae Rourke;
Alias/Nickname: Sofi;
Age: 19;
Gender: Female;
Species/Race: Witch;
Height: 5'1";
